      {
        "name": "places/ChIJJ2Voy4oJBDQRh7Wq4qXI-RM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25keWRGVnZXVWh6YUZodlExRm9hV2R1UkZsek4xRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "晚上十點左右來的，本來想吃頓美味的宵夜，結果一碗簡單的麵條（所謂的招牌菜）等了半個小時都沒上。我用二維碼點的餐，服務生對我視而不見，連杯水都沒給我。沒人告訴我我的訂單狀況，我就直接走了。食物怎麼樣？我想我永遠不會知道了，而且我也永遠不想知道。千萬別來這家店🙏🏻",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Came here at around 22:00 hoping for a savoury late night dinner, but a simple bowl of noodles (so called signature dish) didn’t have a single sign of arrival after 30 minutes. I made my order via QR code and no stuff gave a damn about my existence, and not even a cup of water was offered during the long wait. No one told me anything about my order and I just walked out. How’s the food? I guess I will never know and I would never want to know. A place to avoid at all cost 🙏🏻",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
